flowchart TD
    A[Authorized repayment operation] --> P{Initially payable?}
    P -->|No| N[REPAYMENT_INSTALLMENT_NOT_PAYABLE 409]
    P -->|Yes| I{Canonical active intent exists?}
    I -->|Yes| S[Idempotent success]
    I -->|No| U[Run state qualified installment update]

    U -->|One row updated| E[Publish one repayment event]
    U -->|No row updated| R[Reload trusted installment state]

    R --> C{Observed result}
    C -->|Same intent already applied| S
    C -->|Competing incompatible state| X[REPAYMENT_STATE_CONFLICT 409]
    C -->|Missing internal resource| M[Entity specific 404]

    E --> K[Commit payment repayment outbox and audit]
    S --> J[Commit without duplicate effects]
    X --> B[Roll back transaction]
    M --> B
    B --> Z[No repayment event notification or audit effect]

